{"text": "El Sol siguió calentando sin quemar. Al viajero le entró calor y decidió quitarse el abrigo. Lo dobló sobre su brazo y descansó junto a un árbol. Nadie se lo había arrancado: él mismo eligió hacerlo al sentirse cómodo. Viajero: Guardaré el abrigo hasta que lo necesite.", "words": [{"start": 0.109083, "end": 0.345374, "from": 0, "to": 2}, {"start": 0.360125, "end": 0.640708, "from": 3, "to": 6}, {"start": 0.6555, "end": 1.069, "from": 7, "to": 13}, {"start": 1.083791, "end": 1.777916, "from": 14, "to": 24}, {"start": 1.792666, "end": 2.014207, "from": 25, "to": 28}, {"start": 2.028958, "end": 2.590166, "from": 29, "to": 35}, {"start": 3.61825, "end": 3.854541, "from": 37, "to": 39}, {"start": 3.869333, "end": 4.371458, "from": 40, "to": 47}, {"start": 4.386208, "end": 4.489583, "from": 48, "to": 50}, {"start": 4.504375, "end": 4.858833, "from": 51, "to": 56}, {"start": 4.873583, "end": 5.272333, "from": 57, "to": 62}, {"start": 5.287083, "end": 5.346166, "from": 63, "to": 64}, {"start": 5.360958, "end": 5.951708, "from": 65, "to": 72}, {"start": 5.966458, "end": 6.557208, "from": 73, "to": 81}, {"start": 6.571958, "end": 6.675333, "from": 82, "to": 84}, {"start": 6.690083, "end": 7.236499, "from": 85, "to": 91}, {"start": 8.255541, "end": 8.432749, "from": 93, "to": 95}, {"start": 8.447541, "end": 8.787207, "from": 96, "to": 101}, {"start": 8.802, "end": 9.112125, "from": 102, "to": 107}, {"start": 9.126875, "end": 9.289333, "from": 108, "to": 110}, {"start": 9.304125, "end": 9.688125, "from": 111, "to": 116}, {"start": 9.702875, "end": 9.761958, "from": 117, "to": 118}, {"start": 9.776708, "end": 10.441291, "from": 119, "to": 127}, {"start": 10.456041, "end": 10.795707, "from": 128, "to": 133}, {"start": 10.8105, "end": 10.840041, "from": 134, "to": 135}, {"start": 10.854791, "end": 11.061541, "from": 136, "to": 138}, {"start": 11.076333, "end": 11.593208, "from": 139, "to": 144}, {"start": 12.61225, "end": 13.040541, "from": 146, "to": 151}, {"start": 13.